OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain soon
OL,6,Fclears to give a dry and settled
OL,7,Fnight, with the wind gradually easing
OL,8,Fto a light breeze. Feeling chilly as
OL,9,Ftemperatures drop to single figures.
OL,10,FMist or fog patches and a grass frost
OL,11,Fare likely in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAny mist or fog should soon
OL,14,Fclear to leave a fine day with light
OL,15,Fwinds and prolonged sunshine, perhaps
OL,16,Fhazy at times. Feeling warm in places
OL,17,Fby the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
