OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand breezy on Tuesday, with a warm
OL,7,Fnight. Rain, heavy at times, followed
OL,8,Fby a brighter evening for most on
OL,9,FWednesday. Settled and dry on
OL,10,FThursday. Above-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
